  <History Date="14-01-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="15-09-10" Author="Jonathan Moreton" Comment="Added Shortname" />
  <History Date="26-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Renamed existing dimmer to control.  Added v-dim.  Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="22-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed manufacturer name from Mega-Lite to Mega Lite." />
  <History Date="22-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed model name from NE Colorstrip to N-E Color Strip.  Revised macro function names." />
  <History Date="22-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added RGB masters and fixed RGB cell links.  Changed cell to hidden." />
